<title>USA: U.S. Home to buy back up to 750,000 shares.</title>
<headline>U.S. Home to buy back up to 750,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Home Corp said Wednesday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to 750,000 shares or warrants.</p>
<p>The homebuilder said the buyback is being initiated to avoid future dilutive impact from the exercise of outstanding warrants that expire June 21, 1998.</p>
<p>ln addition to the open market repurchase of the shares or warrants, the company said it intends to initiate an odd-lot repurchase program for holders of less than 100 shares.</p>
